# Kuja, Genome Sorcerer: at the beginning of your end step it creates a tapped 0/1 black Wizard whose cast trigger deals 1 damage to
# each opponent, and transforms once you control four or more Wizards. Turn 1: Kuja, then the first Wizard (Kuja and it are two).
# Turn 3: Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt: the Wizard pings for 1, then the Bolt deals 3 (Bot2 20 -> 16); the end step makes the second
# Wizard: three Wizards are not enough. Turn 5 the third Wizard makes four, and Kuja transforms into Trance Kuja, Fate Defied.

